# ── zsh-abbr — abbreviations expand visibly on <space> ────────────────
# Abbreviations are pre-populated in
#   $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/zsh-abbr/user-abbreviations
# zsh-abbr loads them automatically at plugin init (zero per-shell cost).
#
# To add: `abbr add <key>=<expansion>`  (writes to the same file)
# To list: `abbr list`
# To remove: `abbr erase <key>`
#
# Aliases in 80-aliases.zsh still cover the same shortcuts for non-interactive
# use, so abbreviations and aliases coexist cleanly.
:
